<tab><cl=F0F010>MAGAZINE <cl=A2A2A2><br><br>
<tab>Important messages about your character are recorded in the log.
If your character has an inkwell, you can log entries yourself. To do this, select the item: <cl=FFFFFF>New entry<cl=B0B0B0>. You can view the recording using the appropriate button or by double-clicking the mouse. To delete a record, select it by clicking the left mouse button and select the item: <cl=FFFFFF>Delete record<cl=B0B0B0>. The removal takes place without an additional question.<br>
}